<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">STUDIO · GROWTH</view><view class="title">每一次创作，都值得被看见</view><view class="muted">连接课堂里的探索与家庭里的陪伴。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{success}}" class="success">{{success}}</view><view class="card" wx:if="{{!loggedIn}}"><view>老师与家长登录后查看专属内容</view><button bindtap="signIn" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">微信登录</button></view><view wx:else class="card"><view class="row"><view>{{name || '欢迎回来'}}</view><button class="secondary" size="mini" bindtap="signOut">退出</button></view><view class="row"><button class="secondary" data-role="TEACHER" bindtap="role">老师</button><button class="secondary" data-role="PARENT" bindtap="role">家长</button><button class="secondary" data-role="VISITOR" bindtap="role">访客</button></view><view wx:if="{{role==='TEACHER'}}"><view class="label">当前校区</view><picker range="{{branches}}" range-key="name" bindchange="branch">{{branchName}}</picker><button bindtap="teacher">进入今日教学</button></view><view wx:if="{{role==='PARENT'}}"><view class="label">我的孩子</view><picker range="{{children}}" range-key="name" bindchange="child">{{childName}}</picker><button bindtap="family">查看成长与课表</button><view class="label">绑定新孩子</view><input value="{{code}}" bindinput="code" placeholder="输入前台提供的邀请码"/><button class="secondary" bindtap="bind" disabled="{{busy || !code}}">提交绑定申请</button></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="messages">消息与通知</button></view><view class="card"><view class="title">走进画室</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="studio">画室介绍 / 预约试听 / 活动</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="shop">画室商城</button><button wx:if="{{loggedIn}}" class="secondary" bindtap="orders">我的订单与售后</button></view><view class="card"><view class="title">画室线上展览</view><view class="muted">从孩子的视角，看见不一样的世界。</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="exhibitions">参观作品展</button></view><view class="card"><view>老师首次关联员工账号</view><view class="muted">使用画室分配的员工账号验证身份，之后可以直接微信登录。密码不会保存。</view><input value="{{username}}" data-field="username" bindinput="employeeField" placeholder="员工账号"/><input value="{{password}}" data-field="password" bindinput="employeeField" password placeholder="员工密码"/><button class="secondary" bindtap="linkEmployee" disabled="{{busy || !username || !password}}">验证并关联微信</button></view></view>
